{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demonic</strong> is a classic, old-school RPG set in a seemingly peaceful world that has long forgotten its troubled past. Step into the role of <i>Vincent</i>, a young boy on a journey to uncover not only the truth about himself\u2014but also the hidden history of the world around him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression: Builds &amp; Augments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters by investing in the skills that suit your playstyle. Whether you specialize early or save your points for future upgrades, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your gear through a flexible augment system\u2014boost stats, mix upgrades, and forge a build that reflects your unique approach to combat and exploration.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3493140?t=1754777451","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3493140?t=1754777451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493140/c738c2b73d329899c49c9d6e23d1da565d7ef232/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754777451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493140/c738c2b73d329899c49c9d6e23d1da565d7ef232/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754777451","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3899830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demonic</strong> is a classic, old-school RPG set in a seemingly peaceful world that has long forgotten its troubled past. Step into the role of <i>Vincent</i>, a young boy on a journey to uncover not only the truth about himself\u2014but also the hidden history of the world around him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression: Builds &amp; Augments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your characters by investing in the skills that suit your playstyle. Whether you specialize early or save your points for future upgrades, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your gear through a flexible augment system\u2014boost stats, mix upgrades, and forge a build that reflects your unique approach to combat and exploration.</p>","developers":["Sliff"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493140/ab58ade845b5ab4266a7665db5ba06edb5857f49/header.jpg?t=1754777451","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Demonic","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD A8-7600 / Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3-2105<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> MD Radeon\u2122 R7 Graphics / Intel\u00ae HD Graphics 3000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD A8-7600 / Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3-3225<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon\u2122 R7 Graphics / Intel\u00ae HD Graphics 4000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Ver